{"id":"n65209-1-8","stage":2,"title":"가루 · 粉末","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n65209-1-8-1","ko":"엄마, 지금 과자 먹어도 돼요?","zh":"妈妈，我现在可以吃零食吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"엄마,","meaning":"妈妈","explanation":"엄마：妈妈。","readings":[{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67098","senseId":"1","lemma":"엄마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}},{"text":"지금","meaning":"现在，这会儿","explanation":"지금：现在，这会儿。","readings":[{"term":"지금","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62523","senseId":"1","lemma":"지금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지금","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3"}},{"text":"과자","meaning":"饼干","explanation":"과자：饼干。","readings":[{"term":"과자","audio":"/audio/8cbae77b051c729ee93f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18286","senseId":"1","lemma":"과자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"과자","audio":"/audio/8cbae77b051c729ee93f.mp3"}},{"text":"먹어도","meaning":"吃","explanation":"먹다：吃；어도：表示让步：“即使、就算”；-아/어도 되다 表示“可以”。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"1","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"먹어도","audio":"/audio/c3703871d8ddc398461e.mp3"}},{"text":"돼요?","meaning":"可以、得到允许（-아/어도 되다）","explanation":"되다：可以、得到允许（-아/어도 되다）；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"21","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"돼요","audio":"/audio/9f1cdf460348e44aca12.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"9498f9014908e289","term":"엄마","zh":"妈妈","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3","entryId":"67098","definition":"在非正式场合用于指称或称呼母亲。","pronunciation":["엄마"]},{"id":"df159f47a890ff65","term":"지금","zh":"现在，这会儿","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3","entryId":"62523","definition":"在说话的当时；或此时此刻。","pronunciation":["지금"]},{"id":"8cbae77b051c729e","term":"과자","zh":"饼干","audio":"/audio/8cbae77b051c729ee93f.mp3","entryId":"18286","definition":"把牛奶、白糖等放入面粉或米粉中搅拌后烤制或油炸而成的零食。","pronunciation":["과자"]},{"id":"9639f892bdddb53f","term":"먹다","zh":"吃","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3","entryId":"58272","definition":"将食物送进口中并咽下。","pronunciation":["먹따"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"可以、得到允许（-아/어도 되다）","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"可以、得到允许（-아/어도 되다）","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/6131019a2cb3deef1674.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n65209-1-8-2","ko":"응, 그 대신 바닥에 가루를 흘리지 말고 먹어라.","zh":"可以，不过吃的时候别把碎屑掉在地上。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行。","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}},{"text":"그","meaning":"那个","explanation":"그：那个。","readings":[{"term":"그","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"43883","senseId":"1","lemma":"그","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3"}},{"text":"대신","meaning":"代，替，代替","explanation":"대신：代，替，代替。","readings":[{"term":"대신","audio":"/audio/6180ea39756ca4f7c7ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66262","senseId":"1","lemma":"대신","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"대신","audio":"/audio/6180ea39756ca4f7c7ef.mp3"}},{"text":"바닥에","meaning":"地板","explanation":"바닥：地板；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"바닥","audio":"/audio/18c3f3f4b810aab6c28b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62696","senseId":"4","lemma":"바닥","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"바닥에","audio":"/audio/2a0877f2b7ca0b120f73.mp3"}},{"text":"가루를","meaning":"粉末，面儿","explanation":"가루：粉末，面儿；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"가루","audio":"/audio/42864a47196d1d848539.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65209","senseId":"1","lemma":"가루","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가루를","audio":"/audio/becf42d9f8ccb61d2485.mp3"}},{"text":"흘리지","meaning":"流出来，淌出来，撒出来","explanation":"흘리다：流出来，淌出来，撒出来；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"흘리다","audio":"/audio/a98bf9ca76ba39279166.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91709","senseId":"1","lemma":"흘리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"흘리지","audio":"/audio/614ce2e7692e11b21982.mp3"}},{"text":"말고","meaning":"不要做、停止做（-지 말다）","explanation":"말다：不要做、停止做（-지 말다）；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"말다","audio":"/audio/f8b54c8d9bfb2043a3b8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69296","senseId":"2","lemma":"말다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"말고","audio":"/audio/1473c8e39b00e08bbd22.mp3"}},{"text":"먹어라.","meaning":"吃","explanation":"먹다：吃；어라：向亲近的人或晚辈发出指示、劝告或请求。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"1","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"먹어라","audio":"/audio/367820759d48f2c349ee.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"38c61820e786f234","term":"그","zh":"那个","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3","entryId":"43883","definition":"指代与听话人较近或听话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["그"]},{"id":"6180ea39756ca4f7","term":"대신","zh":"代，替，代替","audio":"/audio/6180ea39756ca4f7c7ef.mp3","entryId":"66262","definition":"由其他对象替代某对象承担的角色；或指承担角色的新对象。","pronunciation":["대ː신"]},{"id":"18c3f3f4b810aab6","term":"바닥","zh":"地板","audio":"/audio/18c3f3f4b810aab6c28b.mp3","entryId":"62696","definition":"建筑物内部的下面部分。","pronunciation":["바닥"]},{"id":"42864a47196d1d84","term":"가루","zh":"粉末，面儿","audio":"/audio/42864a47196d1d848539.mp3","entryId":"65209","definition":"坚硬的物体被粉碎或磨得很小。","pronunciation":["가루"]},{"id":"a98bf9ca76ba3927","term":"흘리다","zh":"流出来，淌出来，撒出来","audio":"/audio/a98bf9ca76ba39279166.mp3","entryId":"91709","definition":"使水或小粒的东西散落或掉落到外面。","pronunciation":["흘리다"]},{"id":"f8b54c8d9bfb2043","term":"말다","zh":"不要做、停止做（-지 말다）","audio":"/audio/f8b54c8d9bfb2043a3b8.mp3","entryId":"69296","definition":"不要做、停止做（-지 말다）","pronunciation":["말ː다"]},{"id":"9639f892bdddb53f","term":"먹다","zh":"吃","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3","entryId":"58272","definition":"将食物送进口中并咽下。","pronunciation":["먹따"]}],"audio":"/audio/07ca4ad5baea6e320776.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.777,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=65209","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":86,"sequenceScore":2.3746,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["妈妈，我现在可以吃零食吗？","可以，但前提是不能把碎屑掉在地上。","在首尔要从前门上车。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["妈妈，我现在可以吃零食吗？","可以，不过吃的时候别把碎屑掉在地上。","在首尔要从前门上车。"],"answer":1}]}
